{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYwmHnELsb8i8TGobAd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**1983 年 1 月 1 日**。这一天 ARPANET 从 NCP 整体切换到 TCP/IP,通常称为\"flag day\"。\n\n- 切换计划由 Jon Postel 在 1981 年的 RFC 801 中提出。\n- 1982 年底,骨干网已有几天对大部分主机关闭了 NCP,作为切换前的演练。\n- 少数站点经骨干网运营方特批,到 1983 年年中仍在用 NCP。\n- 当时约有 400 台主机需要切换。\n- 1983 年 10 月,ARPANET 又拆分出 MILNET。\n\n这些来源多是二手资料(维基百科、新闻报道、邮件列表)。如果需要严谨引用,可以去查 RFC 801 原文。\n\nSources:\n- [Network Control Protocol (ARPANET) – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_Control_Protocol_(ARPANET))\n- [Flag day (computing) – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_day_(computing))\n- [30 Years of TCP/IP Dominance Began with a Deadline – InternetNews](https://internetnews.com/news/30-years-of-tcp-ip-dominance-began-with-a-deadline)\n- [Memories of Flag Day? – ISOC Internet-history 邮件列表](https://elists.isoc.org/pipermail/internet-history/2023-August/008772.html)\n- [Celebrating the Birthday of the Internet – Telepolis](https://telepolis.de/-3428133)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1550, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4302, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1550}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:16:01.624Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYwm2PuutYg3qZbQtXq"}
